    "head_commit_message": "feat(bench): presets, slot scatter and a two-argument-set comparison (spec 39 step 10a)\n\nbreach_tick_phases gains preset=4096|25k (Decision 159's daily bench and\ntarget, series from contact of 4 and 24 lanes of 1,024) and scatter=1\n(each squad's unit-store slots: runs and span against packed). The bench\nworkflow gains base_args, so one commit runs two ways in turn on one runner,\nand scale, which runs bench_scaling.py to check the 4096 bench can stand in\nfor 25k. No outcome changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi31CqVdvAtsDe2Lvb4",
